<div id="pf11" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="11"><div class="pc pc11 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y1c6 w3 h28" alt="" src="bg11.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">4<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>局域网原理与技术<span class="_ _4a"> </span><span class="ff3">4.7<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>截断二进制指数退避算法</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y7e ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">4.7<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">截断二进制指数退避算法</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1a4 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.7.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">算法定义</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1a5 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">该算法用<span class="_ _f"></span>于在<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">CSMA/CD </span>协议中发<span class="_ _f"></span>生冲突后，动<span class="_ _f"></span>态计算重传的<span class="_ _f"></span>推迟时间。它<span class="_ _f"></span>能根据网络<span class="_ _f"></span>拥塞程度（冲突<span class="_ _f"></span>次</div><div class="t m0 x3 h7 y1c7 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">数）自动调整等待时间，以降低再次发生冲突的概率。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1c8 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.7.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">关键参数</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1c9 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本退避时间<span class="ff4">：取争用期<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">2<span class="ff8">𝜏<span class="_ _f"></span></span></span>。对于以太网，通常为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">51<span class="ff8">.<span class="_ _f"></span></span>2<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff8">𝜇<span class="_ _f"></span>𝑠<span class="_ _f"></span></span></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1ca ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">重传次数<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑖<span class="ff4">：记录当前是第几次发生冲突。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1cb ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">参数<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑘<span class="_ _11"></span><span class="ff4">：用于计算退避区间的指数，计算规则为<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>𝑘<span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">min<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ffa">(</span></span></span>𝑖<span class="_ _f"></span>,<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffb">10<span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff4">。</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1cc ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.7.3<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">算法具体步骤</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1cd ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">确定重传次数<span class="ff4">：发生冲突后，重传次数<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑖<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>加<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">1</span>。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1ce ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">计算参数<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑘<span class="_ _11"></span><span class="ff4">：</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7d h7 y1cf ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑘<span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">min<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff4">重传次数<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑖<span class="_ _f"></span>,<span class="_ _e"> </span><span class="ffb">10<span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _4b"> </span><span class="ff3">(4.2)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1d0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">即：当重传次数不超过<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">10<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>时，<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff8">𝑘<span class="_ _9"> </span></span>等于重传次数；当重传次数超过<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">10<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>时，<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff8">𝑘<span class="_ _9"> </span></span>固定为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">10</span>（这就是“截断”的</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1d1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">含义）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1d2 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">选择随机数<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑟<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff4">：从整数集合<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffa">[<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ffb">0</span></span></span>,<span class="_ _e"> </span><span class="ffb">1</span>,<span class="_ _8"> </span>.<span class="_ _8"> </span>.<span class="_ _8"> </span>.<span class="_ _8"> </span>,<span class="_ _e"> </span><span class="ffb">2</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7b h17 y1d3 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑘</div><div class="t m0 x1b h7 y1d2 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">−<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffb">1</span>]<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff4">中随机取出一个数<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑟<span class="_ _f"></span></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x4a h1a y1d4 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑆<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffa">{<span class="ffb">0</span></span></span>,<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffb">1</span>,<span class="_ _8"> </span>.<span class="_ _8"> </span>.<span class="_ _8"> </span>.<span class="_ _8"> </span>,<span class="_ _e"> </span><span class="ffb">2</span></div><div class="t m0 x3c h17 y1d5 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑘</div><div class="t m0 x65 h1a y1d4 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">−<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="_ _f"></span></span>}</div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1d6 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">计算等待时间</span></div><div class="t m0 x27 h7 y1d7 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">：</div><div class="t m0 x7e h7 y1d8 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">等待时间<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑟<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffa">×<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">2</span></span>𝜏<span class="_ _4c"> </span><span class="ff3">(4.3)</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1d9 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">失败判定<span class="ff4">：若重传次数<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑖<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>达到<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">16 </span></span>次<span class="ff4">仍不成功，则丢弃该帧，并向高层报告传输失败。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">12<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
